  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NE HIV/AIDS-UNAIDS</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">NE HIV/AIDS-UNAIDS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida has entered into an agreement with UNAIDS for funding the Northeast States as part of the Joint Programme of the Northeast. Other donors such as AusAID through UNAIDS are also supporting specific interventions in select states of the Northeast. Sida funding will complement the overall Northeast initiative in line with the priorities of Sida, with a strong component on strengthening the</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">civil society&apos;s role in the response to HIV/AIDS.The overall project goal is to contribute to the national response in reducing the risk and impact of HIV/AIDS in 4 states of North East India. The component objectives of the Project will help in fulfilling the purpose of increasing the regional capacity and improving the quality of the national response in the 4 states.</narrative>
  </description>
